From: Miures Manager <contact@miures.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 09:15:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] October 2026 review: builder sections and respondent
 behaviour (48 items)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Both review spreadsheets (02-10-2026_question.xlsx, 2_10_26.xlsx), mapped
item by item in docs/OCTOBER-REVIEW-BUILDERS-2026-10-06.md — 45 complete,
3 partial (Video Rating holds one clip; Conditional Form's type list is an
interpretation; Editable Table "+ Add row" reveals authored rows).

- Search box offered only where a renderer draws one (source-scan test).
- Numeric: per-subtype controls (numberInput), decimal places, sign.
- One Pairwise Choice with "+ Field" adding whole pairs; the older single
  comparison stays loadable and converts.
- Numeric / date ranges follow the field type; order checked per type.
- Image Categorization and Drag into Buckets: image chips into drop zones,
  bucket rules (bucketRules.ts) enforced by renderer and validator.
- Video Rating / Hotspot / Watch-Time: clip list, playback settings,
  rating types, optional comment (__comment / _COMMENT), Next held until
  a required clip ends.
- Date / time: default value, 8 date formats, 12/24 h, seconds.
- Uploads: accepted types, min/max files, size and total, sheet wording;
  Photo Capture images only.
- Form fields: per-variant type policies, same-type ranges, phone code
  list with per-country validation, Editable Table columns + row settings.
- Swipe decks: rich cards (image, subtitle, information, price, fields),
  card display and swipe settings, Rate / Rank / Categorize.

Every new setting is optional; existing surveys are unchanged.
Tests: engine 1674, studio 262, all packages green; new browser suite
october-review-test (15 checks); 29/29 mutations caught.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
